# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>.
#
# RFC 9116 defines /.well-known/security.txt as the only valid location, and
# that is where the real file lives (static/.well-known/security.txt). Some
# scanners and older tooling still probe the document root, so point them at
# the canonical copy rather than maintaining two files that can drift.
#
# Pages only consults this file when no static asset matches the request path,
# so a rule can never shadow a real file.

/security.txt  /.well-known/security.txt  301
